@EmployeeManagementSystem_HostAddress = http://localhost:5063

### Sample request to create a new employee
POST http://localhost:5063/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin123"
}

### Sample request to get all employees (requires authentication)
GET http://localhost:5063/api/Employees
Authorization: Bearer {your_jwt_token_here}